sequenceDiagram
    participant U as 用户程序 ring3
    participant CPU as CPU 硬件
    participant TSS as TSS
    participant ISR as isr_syscall
    participant C as syscall_handler

    U->>CPU: int 0x80
    CPU->>TSS: 读 esp0/ss0
    CPU->>CPU: 切内核栈，压 ss/esp/eflags/cs/eip
    CPU->>ISR: 跳转到 isr_syscall

    ISR->>ISR: testl $3,%ecx → ring3
    ISR->>ISR: push err/ds/pushal
    ISR->>ISR: lcr3(kernel_pgdir)
    ISR->>C: syscall_handler(tf)

    C-->>ISR: return
    ISR->>ISR: popal/pop ds，跳过 err
    ISR->>ISR: lcr3(user_pgdir)
    ISR->>CPU: iret
    CPU->>U: 恢复 ring3 继续执行